<main class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Help improve EvonyMasters</div><h1>Contact & feedback</h1>
<p>Found incorrect reward data, a missing monster, a broken search or an idea for a new tool? We want to hear about it.</p>
<section class="panel"><h2>Report a problem or suggest a feature</h2>
<p>Email our team directly with feedback, corrections or feature suggestions.</p>
<a class="button" href="mailto:contact@evonymasters.com?subject=EvonyMasters%20Feedback">Email contact@evonymasters.com ↗</a>
<p class="note">Please do not include your Evony account password, account credentials or other sensitive information.</p></section>
<section><h2>What to include</h2><p>Tell us which page or tool you used, what item or monster you searched for, what result you expected and what happened instead. If reporting incorrect game data, include the in-game source and date if available.</p></section>
<section><h2>Other ways to help</h2><p>Share the tools with your alliance, test them on different devices or propose corrections to our reward database. For any question or suggestion, email <a href="mailto:contact@evonymasters.com">contact@evonymasters.com</a>.</p></section>
<footer><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></footer>
</main></body></html>